  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Open Forum och Concord 2009-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Concord - Support to Concord and Open Forum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONCORD Europe is the financial manager for the CSO network &quot;Open     Forum for Development Effectiveness&quot;. The aim with the programme is   that CSOs will develop guidelines for how CSOs can work according to  development effectiveness principles. They will also develop minimum  standards for an enabling environment for CSOs. The process will      include around 50 regional, thematic and country consultations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CONCORD Europe &#xe4;r &quot;financial manager&quot; f&#xf6;r Open Forum for development  effectiveness som &#xe4;r en sammanslutning av CSOs. Syftet med programmet &#xe4;r att CSOs ska ta fram riktlinjer f&#xf6;r hur CSOs kan arbeta enligt     bist&#xe5;ndseffektivitetsprinciper. De kommer ocks&#xe5; att ta fram minimum   standards f&#xf6;r en &quot;enabling environment&quot; f&#xf6;r CSOs. Processen kommer    att omfatta ett 50 tal regionala, tematiska och landkonsultationer.</narrative>
  </description>
